    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME are delighted to present No. 4 Morell Manor, a beautifully presented and upgraded 4-bedroom detached home overlooking a mature green in this highly sought-after Naas development. This impressive property has been finished to a superb standard throughout, blending contemporary style with generous, family-friendly proportions. Downstairs you will be greeted with a large family size lounge with bay window and open fireplace, which overlooks the large green area to the front. The L-shaped kitchen/dining room is flooded with natural light and fitted with painted cabinetry complimented by Quartz tops and backsplash, peninsula island with seating and integrated appliances. French doors from the dining area lead to the beautifully landscaped, low maintenance rear garden; an ideal entertaining space. A separate laundry/utility room and stylish guest WC complete the ground floor. Upstairs, the spacious landing leads to four well-appointed bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom features extensive walnut wardrobes and a private en-suite. A modern family bathroom completes the first floor. To the rear, the garden is fully landscaped with a large porcelain patio areas, central no maintenance lawn and contemporary composite privacy fencing making it ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining and is complimented by ambient outdoor lighting. The front offers a cobble locked driveway, 2 side entrances, landscaped lawn and neat hedging as well as a practical EV charger. Viewing strictly by appointment with CME, Naas; 045 897711."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\r\nC.4.75m x 1.90m\r\nBeautifully finished with oak effect laminate flooring. Part glazed door to lounge and to kitchen/diningroom Radiator Cover. Understairs storage. Composite front door. Attractive geometric stair carpet leading to first floor.\r\n\r\nGuest WC:\r\nc. 1.90m x 1.40m\r\nWith WC, pedestal wash basin and window.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\r\nc. 6.20m x 3.85m\r\nSpacious bay-windowed reception room with feature fireplace and glazed double doors connecting to Kitchen/dining room. Coving to ceiling. Laminate wood flooring\r\n\r\nDining Area:\r\nc. 4.35m x 3.85m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. French doors to rear garden. Ideal for entertaining.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\nc. 5.45m x 2.75m\r\nAttractive painted cabinetry with quartz-style worktops and splashback and some integrated appliances. Island seating area. Velux roof window and a large picture window overlooking the garden.\r\n\r\nLaundry / Utility:\r\nc. 1.90m x 1.40m\r\nDedicated utility area with additional storage and appliance space.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:\r\nc. 3.55m x 3.35m\r\nFront aspect. Extensive walnut fitted wardrobes. Laminate wood \r\nflooring.\r\n\r\nEn Suite:\r\nc. 2.30m x 0.90m\r\nFully tiled with shower, WC and circular basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nc. 3.80m x 3.45m\r\nRear aspect double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and laminate floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nc. 3.80m x 2.40m\r\nBright double bedroom with modern flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\r\nc. 2.95m x 2.40m\r\nLaminate flooring. Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nc. 2.55m x 1.90m\r\nModern bathroom, fully tiled, with walk in shower, WC and wall hung wash basin. LED light mirror. Wall mounted heated towel rail."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning Detached home overlooking green area to front\r\n4 Bedrooms, all with fitted wardrobes\r\nBeautiful L-Shaped kitchen/Dining room with painted cabinetry, Quartz Worktops & Peninsula Island\r\nSpacious Lounge with Fireplace and Bay window\r\nAttractive glazed doors to ground floor affording maximum light\r\nGuest WC &Separate laundry/utility room\r\nEn suite to principal bedroom\r\nBeautiful fully landscaped, low maintenance rear garden with porcelain patio areas and composite fencing \r\nLocated within a few minutes of Monread Park, Tesco Monread and Sallins Train station as well as the many amenities of Naas"
      },
      {
